The following fonts belonging to the Computer Modern Unicode font family are included:

cmunit - Typewriter-Italic
cmunrm - Serif-Roman
cmunsi - SansSerif-Oblique
cmunsl - Serif-RomanSlanted
cmunss - SansSerif
cmunti - Serif-Italic
cmuntt - Typewriter-Regular

For more information on these fonts and to see what some of them look like, please visit:
http://canopus.iacp.dvo.ru/~panov/cm-unicode/

